ame>Henry</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Reed</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Krummenacker</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Joyce</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Karp</surname><given-names>PD</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>A genome-scale metabolic reconstruction for <italic>Escherichia coli</italic> K-12 MG1655 that accounts for 1260 ORFs and thermodynamic information</article-title><source>Mol Syst Biol</source><year>2007</year><volume>3</volume><fpage>121</fpage><lpage>138</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17593909</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Friedl</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kubicek</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Druzhinina</surname><given-names>IS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Carbon source dependence and photostimulation of conidiation in <italic>Hypocrea atroviridis</italic></article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>2008a</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>245</fpage><lpage>250</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17981948</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Friedl</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmoll</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kubicek</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Druzhinina</surname><given-names>IS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Photostimulation of <italic>Hypocrea atroviridis</italic> growth occurs due to a cross-talk of carbon metabolism, blue light receptors and response to oxidative stress</article-title><source>Microbiology</source><year>2008b</year><volume>154</volume><fpage>1229</fpage><lpage>1241</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="p